00:02:06.694 --> 00:02:15.903
<v Mike Hall>Yeah. And, uh, and Braintree, I know, and I've actually interviewed, uh, one developer from the UTSA, and just extremely well perspective of the development community, uh, in Chicago. Um, uh, but I, so, that's current events, but I, I'm interested in your book, and also the concept of Lean UX that you're teaching.

