<v Bill Scott>Well, you know, fortunately, at the same time, I've hired a friend of mine who used to have a search at Netflix. He'd gone on to be the CTO of mobile at Zynga. Previously, he had been at Amazon to help build the initial cloud and even in the early days of Mac OS. So the guy's a well-traveled.

00:08:57.238 --> 00:08:57.384
