<v Bill Scott>And then, of course, Jeff Harrell on my team is just really brilliant. And another guy, Eric, that I brought from Netflix and a few other folks have been from Netflix. They're just really smart, awesome guys who get the full package of not just, it's not just engineering, but it's design. It's customer-centric. And that's what drives someone like Emmanuel, right?

